            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Later Life and Recognition</strong><br>\nAfter leaving office, Thatcher continued to influence politics and was granted a life peerage as Baroness Thatcher.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Controversial Figure</strong><br>\nDespite being a divisive figure due to her policies' impact on British society, Thatcher is remembered for her strong leadership style and her role in ending the Cold War.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Legacy</strong><br>\nShe passed away in 2013, leaving behind a complex legacy that continues to shape political discourse in the UK and around the world.</p>\n"
              },
